{"id":"0ceb6865f96db106","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-pcf2-spectrum.md","title":"ZFC Pcf2 Spectrum","display":"df-zfc-pcf2-spectrum — ZFC Pcf2 Spectrum","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-spectrum","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf2-spectrum"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf2-spectrum — ZFC Pcf2 Spectrum","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-pcf2-possible-cofinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-spectrum"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf2-spectrum</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf2-spectrum — ZFC Pcf2 Spectrum"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"13b44f8137f7b9f8\" href=\"?note=13b44f8137f7b9f8\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-pcf2-possible-cofinality.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-pcf2-possible-cofinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,S\\in V\">\\(A,S\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2PossibleCofinality}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2PossibleCofinality}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Spectrum}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Spectrum}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}spectrum}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Spectrum}_S(A,S)\\leftrightarrow S=\\{\\lambda&lt;|\\prod A|^+:\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2PossibleCofinality}_S(A,\\lambda)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}spectrum}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Spectrum}_S(A,S)\\leftrightarrow S=\\{\\lambda&lt;|\\prod A|^+:\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2PossibleCofinality}_S(A,\\lambda)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The bounding successor cardinal makes the spectrum an explicitly separated set; any true cofinality of a reduced product on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> lies below this bound.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-pcf2-possible-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"13b44f8137f7b9f8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-pcf2-possible-cofinality.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,S\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2PossibleCofinality}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Spectrum}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf2\\text{-}spectrum}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2Spectrum}_S(A,S)\\leftrightarrow S=\\{\\lambda<|\\prod A|^+:\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2PossibleCofinality}_S(A,\\lambda)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":808,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3057","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-pcf2-spectrum.md|58-df-zfc-pcf2-spectrum]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["13b44f8137f7b9f8"]}